---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Application — Custom Software Solutions | Facware"
  description="Build and deploy custom business applications tailored to your operations. Facware creates scalable, secure applications that integrate with your existing systems and grow with your business."
  canonicalURL="https://facware.com/products/application.html"
  ogDescription="Facware's Application solution: custom-built business applications that integrate with your stack and scale with your operations."
>
  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <i class="fas fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:10px"></i>
        <span aria-current="page">Application</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Application</h1>
      <p>Custom business applications built to replace your fragmented tools. One integrated system that handles your core workflows, scales with your team, and delivers measurable ROI from day one.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FEATURES -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="app-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header text-center">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">Product</p>
        <h2 id="app-heading">One application replaces the whole stack</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Stop duct-taping separate tools together. Our custom applications consolidate your workflows into a single, secure platform that your team actually wants to use.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="cards-grid cards-3">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><img src="/assets/images/icons/mitech-box-image-style-05-image-04-60x60.webp" width="60" height="60" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Scalable Architecture</h3>
          <p class="card-text">Built on modern, cloud-ready architecture. Whether you have 10 users or 10,000, your application scales without re-platforming or performance headaches.</p>
          <a href="/services/system-architecture.html" class="card-link">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><img src="/assets/images/icons/mitech-box-image-style-05-image-05-60x60.webp" width="60" height="60" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Secure &amp; Compliant</h3>
          <p class="card-text">Role-based access, audit logging, and data encryption built in from day one. Meets compliance requirements for Mexico and US Southwest operations out of the box.</p>
          <a href="/services/it-consulting.html" class="card-link">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><img src="/assets/images/icons/mitech-box-image-style-05-image-06-60x60.webp" width="60" height="60" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Rapid Deployment</h3>
          <p class="card-text">Most applications go live in 3–6 weeks. We use proven patterns and modular design so your team sees value fast — not after 12 months of development.</p>
          <a href="/services/custom-software-development.html" class="card-link">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="section-cta-note text-center" style="margin-top:48px">
        <p>Have a specific workflow that needs an application? Let us know. <a href="/contact.html" class="link-primary">Talk to an expert &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section section--gray" aria-labelledby="app-cta-heading">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;max-width:680px;">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Build your application</p>
      <h2 id="app-cta-heading" style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin:0 0 14px;">Replace the patchwork</h2>
      <p style="color:#5a6580;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 28px;">A custom application eliminates the integration tax. One platform, one codebase, one team accountable for the outcome.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-primary">Start your project &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>